$-45$；　　в) $4.6$；　　г) $-10.2$；\",\n              \"д) $15\\\\frac{1}{6}$；　　е) $-11\\\\frac{2}{3}$；　　ж) $\\\\frac{130}{78}$；　　з) $-\\\\frac{38}{95}$\"\n            ],\n            \"pages\": [\n              \"p0197#8\",\n              \"p0198#1\"\n            ],\n            \"figure_refs\": [],\n            \"figures\": []\n          },\n          {\n            \"number\": \"708\",\n            \"source_number\": \"708\",\n            \"group\": null,\n            \"group_id\": \"g0\",\n            \"text\": \"708. 设 $a\\\\in N$，$b\\\\in N$. 下列说法对吗？а) $a+b\\\\in N$；　　б) $a-b\\\\in N$；в) $ab\\\\in N$；　　г) $\\\\frac{a}{b}\\\\in N$.\",\n            \"lines\": [\n              \"708. 设 $a\\\\in N$，$b\\\\in N$. 下列说法对吗？\",\n              \"а) $a+b\\\\in N$；　　б) $a-b\\\\in N$；\",\n              \"в) $ab\\\\in N$；　　г) $\\\\frac{a}{b}\\\\in N$.\"\n            ],\n            \"pages\": [\n              \"p0198#2\"\n            ],\n            \"figure_refs\": [],\n            \"figures\": []\n          },\n          {\n            \"number\": \"709\",\n            \"source_number\": \"709\",\n            \"group\": null,\n            \"group_id\": \"g0\",\n            \"text\": \"709. 设 $a\\\\in Z$，$b\\\\in Z$. 下列说法对吗？а) $a+b\\\\in Z$；　　б) $a-b\\\\in Z$；в) $ab\\\\in Z$；　　г) $\\\\frac{a}{b}\\\\in Z\\\\ (b\\\\ne 0)$.\",\n            \"lines\": [\n              \"709. 设 $a\\\\in Z$，$b\\\\in Z$. 下列说法对吗？\",\n              \"а) $a+b\\\\in Z$；　　б) $a-b\\\\in Z$；\",\n              \"в) $ab\\\\in Z$；　　г) $\\\\frac{a}{b}\\\\in Z\\\\ (b\\\\ne 0)$.\"\n            ],\n            \"pages\": [\n              \"p0198#3\"\n            ],\n            \"figure_refs\": [],\n            \"figures\": []\n          },\n          {\n            \"number\": \"710\",\n            \"source_number\": \"710\",\n            \"group\": null,\n            \"group_id\": \"g0\",\n            \"text\": \"710. 设 $a\\\\in Q$，$b\\\\in Q$. 下列说法对吗？а) $a+b\\\\in Q$；　　б) $a-b\\\\in Q$；в) $ab\\\\in Q$；　　г) $\\\\frac{a}{b}\\\\in Q\\\\ (b\\\\ne 0)$.\",\n            \"lines\": [\n              \"710. 设 $a\\\\in Q$，$b\\\\in Q$. 下列说法对吗？\",\n              \"а) $a+b\\\\in Q$；　　б) $a-b\\\\in Q$；\",\n              \"в) $ab\\\\in Q$；　　г) $\\\\frac{a}{b}\\\\in Q\\\\ (b\\\\ne 0)$.\"\n            ],\n            \"pages\": [\n              \"p0198#4\"\n            ],\n            \"figure_refs\": [],\n            \"figures\": []\n          },\n          {\n            \"number\": \"711\",\n            \"source_number\": \"711\",\n            \"group\": \"复习题\",\n            \"group_id\": \"g1\",\n            \"text\": \"711. 当 $a$ 取什么值时，函数 $y=ax^2$ 的图象通过点 $M(0.1,5)$？\",\n            \"lines\": [\n              \"711. 当 $a$ 取什么值时，函数 $y=ax^2$ 的图象通过点 $M(0.1,↵5)$？\"\n            ],\n            \"pages\": [\n              \"p0198#6\"\n            ],\n            \"figure_refs\": [],\n            \"figures\": []\n          },\n          {\n            \"number\": \"712\",\n            \"source_number\": \"712\",\n            \"group\": \"复习题\",\n            \"group_id\": \"g1\",\n            \"text\": \"712. 当 $k$ 取什么值时，函数 $y=kx+1.2$ 的图象通过点$E(-0.7,-3)$？这个函数的图象通过点 $C(-15,88.8)$吗？\",\n            \"lines\": [\n              \"712. 当 $k$ 取什么值时，函数 $y=kx+1.2$ 的图象通过点\",\n              \"$E(-0.7,-3)$？这个函数的图象通过点 $C(-15,88.8)$\",\n              \"吗？\"\n            ],\n            \"pages\": [\n              \"p0198#7\"\n            ],\n            \"figure_refs\": [],\n            \"figures\": []\n          }\n        ]\n      }\n    }\n  },\n  \"checks\": [\n    {\n      \"target\": \"lesson[0]\",\n      \"errors\": [],\n      \"mathSignaturePreserved\": true,\n      \"numberSignaturePreserved\": true\n    },\n    {\n      \"target\": \"lesson[1]\",\n      \"errors\": [],\n      \"mathSignaturePreserved\": true,\n      \"numberSignaturePreserved\": true\n    },\n    {\n      \"target\": \"lesson[2]\",\n      \"errors\": [],\n      \"mathSignaturePreserved\": true,\n      \"numberSignaturePreserved\"